['Below is a C function implementing the requested dynamic array management for `NR UE Measurement Report PDU` structures. It includes memory allocation with retry logic, structure population, validation, sorting, filtering, and integration considerations.

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>
#include <time.h>
